  <item>
    <title>Vol.7君子和而不同</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/650bb1a89687557971dc2efa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">650bb1a89687557971dc2efa</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Sep 2023 02:59:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>简介</span></h2><span></span><p><span>随着在一起的时间增加，激情慢慢褪去，矛盾逐渐浮现。老大和小孩各有各的特点，他们是怎么互相兼容，彼此关爱的？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>正文</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 领导总结发言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> 小孩总结问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a> 一些看起来简单实际很复杂的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="354">05:54</a> 人与人的差异比人与猪都大，尊重差异，放过彼此</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="723">12:03</a>为什么一年和七年容易分手？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 一个具体的吵架案例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a> 吵架发生后，小孩在想什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1208">20:08</a> 降低要求，解放别人，解放自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a> 小技巧：在交流中有情绪时，主动说出自己当下的感觉以及为什么会有这种感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a> 安利一个软件：bitwarden密码管理工具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a> 第二个案例：我这是为你好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1678">27:58</a> 第二个小技巧：一点小零食，换来好心情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1924">32:04</a> 各类技巧也都是来自于其他人的分享，但所有技巧都要看完用起来，才算真的掌握了</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制于2023-06-23</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luxjMgu8lOOw4JDBXDSo5Sv_A1sx.m4a" length="66970333" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvEDN0nIskPv0Zs_FKElXxhDMBOQ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
