    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好呀！今天是情人节，不知道大家都是怎么过的呢？这期播客和大家聊聊这次老孩儿对过情人节这件事的看法。大家期待过节，其实都是期待那一份“仪式感”。老孩儿希望大家在平时也能够营造一些独属于自己或自己和伴侣的仪式感。在本期节目中，我们分享了一些日常中觉得比较有助于营造仪式感的事情，希望对你们有所启发。如果你的情人节有特别的经历，欢迎大家在评论区留言和我们分享。最后，无论你是怎么过的这个情人节，我们都祝愿你永远有爱与被爱的勇气和幸运，祝大家情人节快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>------</span></p><span></span><h1><span>节日有那么重要吗？为什么必须过节日？</span></h1><span></span><p><span>印象最深刻的不是哪个节日，而是一个又一个普通但充满意义的小事</span></p><span></span><h1><span>为什么不过节日</span></h1><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>太贵了！最近吃饭竟然整个一月到二月都不打折！平时工作日去吃东西又没人抢又便宜😋</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>仪式感不仅靠节日带来，更重要的是自己创造</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h1><span>怎么过好每个日常</span></h1><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>只有节日才示爱是可悲的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>送礼不一定得多么贵重，有心的话，一朵花，一袋糖都会很开心</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>为什么录播客？因为会感受到爱呀</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>玩游戏多香啊！推荐几个游戏吧，《双人成行》、《双子》、《ticktock》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>出去玩呀！打扮的漂漂亮亮，喷一点好闻的香水，和对方品尝美食留下纪念意义的照片</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>比如一起做一顿饭（冬至自己煮饺子吃）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>重点在于有心。出去逛一圈买一根糖葫芦看看月亮也很浪漫。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ol><span></span><h1><span>------</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>相关信息源</span></h1><span></span><h3><span>书籍</span></h3><span></span><p><span>《男人来自火星，女人来自金星》： </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/26769591/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/26769591/"><span>男人来自火星,女人来自金星 (豆瓣) (douban.com)</span></a></p><span></span><h3><br></h3><span></span><h3><span>游戏</span></h3><span></span><p><span>《双人成行》：</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/game/35110438/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/game/35110438/"><span>双人成行 It Takes Two (豆瓣) (douban.com)</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《双子 GEMINI》：</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/game/27007862/#:~:text=%E8%BF%91%E6%97%A5%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E5%9B%A2%E9%98%9F%20Echostone%20Games,%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9E%E9%9F%B3%E7%9F%B3%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%AE%A4%EF%BC%89%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%9B%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%20Gemini%20%E3%80%8A%E5%8F%8C%E5%AD%90%E3%80%8B%E6%AD%A3%E5%BC%8F%E5%9C%A8%E5%A4%96%E5%8C%BA%E7%99%BB%E9%99%86%E3%80%82%20%E5%9C%A8%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E7%8E%A9%E5%AE%B6%E5%B0%86%E6%93%8D%E7%BA%B5%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E9%A2%97%E5%B0%8F%E6%98%9F%EF%BC%8C%E5%92%8C%E5%90%8C%E4%BC%B4%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7%E5%9C%A8%E7%A9%BA%E4%B8%AD%E9%A3%9E%E8%88%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%8B%E6%9C%8D%E5%9B%B0%E9%9A%BE%EF%BC%8C%E7%82%B9%E4%BA%AE%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E3%80%82" data-url="https://www.douban.com/game/27007862/#:~:text=%E8%BF%91%E6%97%A5%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E5%9B%A2%E9%98%9F%20Echostone%20Games,%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%9E%E9%9F%B3%E7%9F%B3%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%AE%A4%EF%BC%89%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%9B%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%20Gemini%20%E3%80%8A%E5%8F%8C%E5%AD%90%E3%80%8B%E6%AD%A3%E5%BC%8F%E5%9C%A8%E5%A4%96%E5%8C%BA%E7%99%BB%E9%99%86%E3%80%82%20%E5%9C%A8%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E7%8E%A9%E5%AE%B6%E5%B0%86%E6%93%8D%E7%BA%B5%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E9%A2%97%E5%B0%8F%E6%98%9F%EF%BC%8C%E5%92%8C%E5%90%8C%E4%BC%B4%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7%E5%9C%A8%E7%A9%BA%E4%B8%AD%E9%A3%9E%E8%88%9E%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%8B%E6%9C%8D%E5%9B%B0%E9%9A%BE%EF%BC%8C%E7%82%B9%E4%BA%AE%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E3%80%82"><span>双子 (豆瓣) (douban.com)</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《Tick Tock》：</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/game/30343954/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/game/30343954/"><span>滴答：双人冒险 Tick Tock: A Tale for Two (豆瓣) (douban.com)</span></a></p><span></span><h1><br></h1><span></span><h1><span>BGM</span></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://y.music.163.com/m/song?id=484056997&amp;uct=I4yd57tdAnohf3LzuS56WA%3D%3D&amp;app_version=8.6.70&amp;sc=wmv" data-url="https://y.music.163.com/m/song?id=484056997&amp;uct=I4yd57tdAnohf3LzuS56WA%3D%3D&amp;app_version=8.6.70&amp;sc=wmv"><span>《面会菜》-林生祥</span></a></h1><span></span><p><a href="https://y.music.163.com/m/song?id=1919524258&amp;uct=I4yd57tdAnohf3LzuS56WA%3D%3D&amp;app_version=8.6.70&amp;sc=wmv" data-url="https://y.music.163.com/m/song?id=1919524258&amp;uct=I4yd57tdAnohf3LzuS56WA%3D%3D&amp;app_version=8.6.70&amp;sc=wmv"><span>《One And Only (唯你)》 -满舒克</span></a></p>]]></description>
